### Swipe right on second user (first user swipes)
# Note: replace swiped_id with the actual user ID of the second user
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/v1/swipes/right
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "swiped_id": 2
}

### Swipe right on first user (second user swipes) — creates match!
# Note: replace swiped_id with the actual user ID of the first user
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/v1/swipes/right
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{second_access_token}}

{
  "swiped_id": 1
}

### Swipe left example
POST {{gateway_url}}/api/v1/swipes/left
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "swiped_id": 99
}
